[[:db/add "ccde88b6-ac98-5d48-9756-10d67944b78e" :answer/id #uuid "ccde88b6-ac98-5d48-9756-10d67944b78e"] [:db/add "ccde88b6-ac98-5d48-9756-10d67944b78e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ccde88b6-ac98-5d48-9756-10d67944b78e" :answer/value "- \\frac{3 \\csc{\\left(x^{2} + 2 \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "ccde88b6-ac98-5d48-9756-10d67944b78e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e0be59d9-b5a8-5760-be31-45b6eaff99a3" :answer-field/id #uuid "e0be59d9-b5a8-5760-be31-45b6eaff99a3"] [:db/add "e0be59d9-b5a8-5760-be31-45b6eaff99a3" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "e0be59d9-b5a8-5760-be31-45b6eaff99a3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e0be59d9-b5a8-5760-be31-45b6eaff99a3" :answer-field/choices "ccde88b6-ac98-5d48-9756-10d67944b78e"] [:db/add "e0be59d9-b5a8-5760-be31-45b6eaff99a3" :answer-field/correct "ccde88b6-ac98-5d48-9756-10d67944b78e"] [:db/ensure "e0be59d9-b5a8-5760-be31-45b6eaff99a3" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f5308edd-7673-58fe-9d05-ac0871e43493" :question/id #uuid "f5308edd-7673-58fe-9d05-ac0871e43493"] [:db/add "f5308edd-7673-58fe-9d05-ac0871e43493" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 x \\cot{\\left(x^{2} + 2 \\right)} \\csc{\\left(x^{2} + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "f5308edd-7673-58fe-9d05-ac0871e43493" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{2} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 x.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 x \\cot{\\left(x^{2} + 2 \\right)} \\csc{\\left(x^{2} + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{3 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3 \\csc{\\left(x^{2} + 2 \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f5308edd-7673-58fe-9d05-ac0871e43493" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f5308edd-7673-58fe-9d05-ac0871e43493" :question/answer-fields "e0be59d9-b5a8-5760-be31-45b6eaff99a3"] [:db/ensure "f5308edd-7673-58fe-9d05-ac0871e43493" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "f5308edd-7673-58fe-9d05-ac0871e43493"] [:db/add "cc1437e3-3127-553e-aff2-8606aa433d0d" :answer/id #uuid "cc1437e3-3127-553e-aff2-8606aa433d0d"] [:db/add "cc1437e3-3127-553e-aff2-8606aa433d0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cc1437e3-3127-553e-aff2-8606aa433d0d" :answer/value "- \\cos{\\left(x^{2} + 1 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "cc1437e3-3127-553e-aff2-8606aa433d0d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c4fc48b1-8659-572c-8200-8f98e6cf48c9" :answer-field/id #uuid "c4fc48b1-8659-572c-8200-8f98e6cf48c9"] [:db/add "c4fc48b1-8659-572c-8200-8f98e6cf48c9" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "c4fc48b1-8659-572c-8200-8f98e6cf48c9" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c4fc48b1-8659-572c-8200-8f98e6cf48c9" :answer-field/choices "cc1437e3-3127-553e-aff2-8606aa433d0d"] [:db/add "c4fc48b1-8659-572c-8200-8f98e6cf48c9" :answer-field/correct "cc1437e3-3127-553e-aff2-8606aa433d0d"] [:db/ensure "c4fc48b1-8659-572c-8200-8f98e6cf48c9" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ddddb292-1f71-57a4-beb3-28f714287ab4" :question/id #uuid "ddddb292-1f71-57a4-beb3-28f714287ab4"] [:db/add "ddddb292-1f71-57a4-beb3-28f714287ab4" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 x \\sin{\\left(x^{2} + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "ddddb292-1f71-57a4-beb3-28f714287ab4" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{2} + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 x.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 x \\sin{\\left(x^{2} + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\cos{\\left(x^{2} + 1 \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ddddb292-1f71-57a4-beb3-28f714287ab4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ddddb292-1f71-57a4-beb3-28f714287ab4" :question/answer-fields "c4fc48b1-8659-572c-8200-8f98e6cf48c9"] [:db/ensure "ddddb292-1f71-57a4-beb3-28f714287ab4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "ddddb292-1f71-57a4-beb3-28f714287ab4"] [:db/add "e07b30ad-aa06-521b-b902-c76f75ed2338" :answer/id #uuid "e07b30ad-aa06-521b-b902-c76f75ed2338"] [:db/add "e07b30ad-aa06-521b-b902-c76f75ed2338" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e07b30ad-aa06-521b-b902-c76f75ed2338" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "e07b30ad-aa06-521b-b902-c76f75ed2338" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cd093c04-e9ef-5d69-8a4a-7f5636fa8e1f" :answer-field/id #uuid "cd093c04-e9ef-5d69-8a4a-7f5636fa8e1f"] [:db/add "cd093c04-e9ef-5d69-8a4a-7f5636fa8e1f" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "cd093c04-e9ef-5d69-8a4a-7f5636fa8e1f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "cd093c04-e9ef-5d69-8a4a-7f5636fa8e1f" :answer-field/choices "e07b30ad-aa06-521b-b902-c76f75ed2338"] [:db/add "cd093c04-e9ef-5d69-8a4a-7f5636fa8e1f" :answer-field/correct "e07b30ad-aa06-521b-b902-c76f75ed2338"] [:db/ensure "cd093c04-e9ef-5d69-8a4a-7f5636fa8e1f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "98059661-accc-5315-978a-90a341d6bb2a" :question/id #uuid "98059661-accc-5315-978a-90a341d6bb2a"] [:db/add "98059661-accc-5315-978a-90a341d6bb2a" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 x^{2} \\cos{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "98059661-accc-5315-978a-90a341d6bb2a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 x^{2} \\cos{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "98059661-accc-5315-978a-90a341d6bb2a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "98059661-accc-5315-978a-90a341d6bb2a" :question/answer-fields "cd093c04-e9ef-5d69-8a4a-7f5636fa8e1f"] [:db/ensure "98059661-accc-5315-978a-90a341d6bb2a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "98059661-accc-5315-978a-90a341d6bb2a"] [:db/add "6b769e32-8845-56ab-898e-74647012294d" :answer/id #uuid "6b769e32-8845-56ab-898e-74647012294d"] [:db/add "6b769e32-8845-56ab-898e-74647012294d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6b769e32-8845-56ab-898e-74647012294d" :answer/value "\\frac{\\tan{\\left(x^{3} + 1 \\right)}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "6b769e32-8845-56ab-898e-74647012294d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "92dd62e8-b7ac-5ecc-8995-8dea1a20db53" :answer-field/id #uuid "92dd62e8-b7ac-5ecc-8995-8dea1a20db53"] [:db/add "92dd62e8-b7ac-5ecc-8995-8dea1a20db53" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "92dd62e8-b7ac-5ecc-8995-8dea1a20db53" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "92dd62e8-b7ac-5ecc-8995-8dea1a20db53" :answer-field/choices "6b769e32-8845-56ab-898e-74647012294d"] [:db/add "92dd62e8-b7ac-5ecc-8995-8dea1a20db53" :answer-field/correct "6b769e32-8845-56ab-898e-74647012294d"] [:db/ensure "92dd62e8-b7ac-5ecc-8995-8dea1a20db53" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3503c64b-c34d-5a2f-b993-ed88e86c9520" :question/id #uuid "3503c64b-c34d-5a2f-b993-ed88e86c9520"] [:db/add "3503c64b-c34d-5a2f-b993-ed88e86c9520" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int x^{2} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x^{3} + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "3503c64b-c34d-5a2f-b993-ed88e86c9520" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3} + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int x^{2} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x^{3} + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\tan{\\left(x^{3} + 1 \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "3503c64b-c34d-5a2f-b993-ed88e86c9520" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "3503c64b-c34d-5a2f-b993-ed88e86c9520" :question/answer-fields "92dd62e8-b7ac-5ecc-8995-8dea1a20db53"] [:db/ensure "3503c64b-c34d-5a2f-b993-ed88e86c9520" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "3503c64b-c34d-5a2f-b993-ed88e86c9520"] [:db/add "b7396f35-1ab8-53ba-8d5a-a46dd1780146" :answer/id #uuid "b7396f35-1ab8-53ba-8d5a-a46dd1780146"] [:db/add "b7396f35-1ab8-53ba-8d5a-a46dd1780146" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b7396f35-1ab8-53ba-8d5a-a46dd1780146" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sec{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "b7396f35-1ab8-53ba-8d5a-a46dd1780146" :answer/validate] [:db/add "71e5bf37-d1d5-51b7-b220-136cee071d47" :answer-field/id #uuid "71e5bf37-d1d5-51b7-b220-136cee071d47"] [:db/add "71e5bf37-d1d5-51b7-b220-136cee071d47" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "71e5bf37-d1d5-51b7-b220-136cee071d47" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "71e5bf37-d1d5-51b7-b220-136cee071d47" :answer-field/choices "b7396f35-1ab8-53ba-8d5a-a46dd1780146"] [:db/add "71e5bf37-d1d5-51b7-b220-136cee071d47" :answer-field/correct "b7396f35-1ab8-53ba-8d5a-a46dd1780146"] [:db/ensure "71e5bf37-d1d5-51b7-b220-136cee071d47" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6ae8b686-a96a-50fc-8811-70b1525a9d1d" :question/id #uuid "6ae8b686-a96a-50fc-8811-70b1525a9d1d"] [:db/add "6ae8b686-a96a-50fc-8811-70b1525a9d1d" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int x^{2} \\tan{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)} \\sec{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "6ae8b686-a96a-50fc-8811-70b1525a9d1d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int x^{2} \\tan{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)} \\sec{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sec{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "6ae8b686-a96a-50fc-8811-70b1525a9d1d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "6ae8b686-a96a-50fc-8811-70b1525a9d1d" :question/answer-fields "71e5bf37-d1d5-51b7-b220-136cee071d47"] [:db/ensure "6ae8b686-a96a-50fc-8811-70b1525a9d1d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "6ae8b686-a96a-50fc-8811-70b1525a9d1d"] [:db/add "8d96e438-b7bc-5216-b58a-f610c2253712" :answer/id #uuid "8d96e438-b7bc-5216-b58a-f610c2253712"] [:db/add "8d96e438-b7bc-5216-b58a-f610c2253712" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8d96e438-b7bc-5216-b58a-f610c2253712" :answer/value "- \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "8d96e438-b7bc-5216-b58a-f610c2253712" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0251f4ac-63e8-56d7-ade1-7936222eba9e" :answer-field/id #uuid "0251f4ac-63e8-56d7-ade1-7936222eba9e"] [:db/add "0251f4ac-63e8-56d7-ade1-7936222eba9e" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "0251f4ac-63e8-56d7-ade1-7936222eba9e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0251f4ac-63e8-56d7-ade1-7936222eba9e" :answer-field/choices "8d96e438-b7bc-5216-b58a-f610c2253712"] [:db/add "0251f4ac-63e8-56d7-ade1-7936222eba9e" :answer-field/correct "8d96e438-b7bc-5216-b58a-f610c2253712"] [:db/ensure "0251f4ac-63e8-56d7-ade1-7936222eba9e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ac491912-d824-5384-8703-127f1691c94e" :question/id #uuid "ac491912-d824-5384-8703-127f1691c94e"] [:db/add "ac491912-d824-5384-8703-127f1691c94e" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "ac491912-d824-5384-8703-127f1691c94e" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 x.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ac491912-d824-5384-8703-127f1691c94e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ac491912-d824-5384-8703-127f1691c94e" :question/answer-fields "0251f4ac-63e8-56d7-ade1-7936222eba9e"] [:db/ensure "ac491912-d824-5384-8703-127f1691c94e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "ac491912-d824-5384-8703-127f1691c94e"] [:db/add "0f04a7c2-6cd6-580d-82a3-6cf8a3f4e878" :answer/id #uuid "0f04a7c2-6cd6-580d-82a3-6cf8a3f4e878"] [:db/add "0f04a7c2-6cd6-580d-82a3-6cf8a3f4e878" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0f04a7c2-6cd6-580d-82a3-6cf8a3f4e878" :answer/value "- \\csc{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "0f04a7c2-6cd6-580d-82a3-6cf8a3f4e878" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5411168e-fae7-53b0-bc95-989c45f44b61" :answer-field/id #uuid "5411168e-fae7-53b0-bc95-989c45f44b61"] [:db/add "5411168e-fae7-53b0-bc95-989c45f44b61" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "5411168e-fae7-53b0-bc95-989c45f44b61" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5411168e-fae7-53b0-bc95-989c45f44b61" :answer-field/choices "0f04a7c2-6cd6-580d-82a3-6cf8a3f4e878"] [:db/add "5411168e-fae7-53b0-bc95-989c45f44b61" :answer-field/correct "0f04a7c2-6cd6-580d-82a3-6cf8a3f4e878"] [:db/ensure "5411168e-fae7-53b0-bc95-989c45f44b61" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3b0ac0bb-7ce8-5044-b70d-7560fb1e7c2d" :question/id #uuid "3b0ac0bb-7ce8-5044-b70d-7560fb1e7c2d"] [:db/add "3b0ac0bb-7ce8-5044-b70d-7560fb1e7c2d" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 x^{2} \\cot{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)} \\csc{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "3b0ac0bb-7ce8-5044-b70d-7560fb1e7c2d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 x^{2} \\cot{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)} \\csc{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\csc{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "3b0ac0bb-7ce8-5044-b70d-7560fb1e7c2d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "3b0ac0bb-7ce8-5044-b70d-7560fb1e7c2d" :question/answer-fields "5411168e-fae7-53b0-bc95-989c45f44b61"] [:db/ensure "3b0ac0bb-7ce8-5044-b70d-7560fb1e7c2d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "3b0ac0bb-7ce8-5044-b70d-7560fb1e7c2d"] [:db/add "0ee5177d-e676-5627-870a-0cc765478b65" :answer/id #uuid "0ee5177d-e676-5627-870a-0cc765478b65"] [:db/add "0ee5177d-e676-5627-870a-0cc765478b65" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0ee5177d-e676-5627-870a-0cc765478b65" :answer/value "- \\cos{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "0ee5177d-e676-5627-870a-0cc765478b65" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a4b55cdc-8729-5076-9a78-48d1952ff386" :answer-field/id #uuid "a4b55cdc-8729-5076-9a78-48d1952ff386"] [:db/add "a4b55cdc-8729-5076-9a78-48d1952ff386" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "a4b55cdc-8729-5076-9a78-48d1952ff386" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a4b55cdc-8729-5076-9a78-48d1952ff386" :answer-field/choices "0ee5177d-e676-5627-870a-0cc765478b65"] [:db/add "a4b55cdc-8729-5076-9a78-48d1952ff386" :answer-field/correct "0ee5177d-e676-5627-870a-0cc765478b65"] [:db/ensure "a4b55cdc-8729-5076-9a78-48d1952ff386" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "213953a6-0aa3-5fc6-a5b4-b88d4ecec95f" :question/id #uuid "213953a6-0aa3-5fc6-a5b4-b88d4ecec95f"] [:db/add "213953a6-0aa3-5fc6-a5b4-b88d4ecec95f" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "213953a6-0aa3-5fc6-a5b4-b88d4ecec95f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\cos{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "213953a6-0aa3-5fc6-a5b4-b88d4ecec95f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "213953a6-0aa3-5fc6-a5b4-b88d4ecec95f" :question/answer-fields "a4b55cdc-8729-5076-9a78-48d1952ff386"] [:db/ensure "213953a6-0aa3-5fc6-a5b4-b88d4ecec95f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "213953a6-0aa3-5fc6-a5b4-b88d4ecec95f"] [:db/add "28c836a2-8b2d-50c3-b89d-9bd2bc1ee84e" :answer/id #uuid "28c836a2-8b2d-50c3-b89d-9bd2bc1ee84e"] [:db/add "28c836a2-8b2d-50c3-b89d-9bd2bc1ee84e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "28c836a2-8b2d-50c3-b89d-9bd2bc1ee84e" :answer/value "- 3 \\sec{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "28c836a2-8b2d-50c3-b89d-9bd2bc1ee84e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "87314e5a-9205-558c-9967-f8c8388551d2" :answer-field/id #uuid "87314e5a-9205-558c-9967-f8c8388551d2"] [:db/add "87314e5a-9205-558c-9967-f8c8388551d2" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "87314e5a-9205-558c-9967-f8c8388551d2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "87314e5a-9205-558c-9967-f8c8388551d2" :answer-field/choices "28c836a2-8b2d-50c3-b89d-9bd2bc1ee84e"] [:db/add "87314e5a-9205-558c-9967-f8c8388551d2" :answer-field/correct "28c836a2-8b2d-50c3-b89d-9bd2bc1ee84e"] [:db/ensure "87314e5a-9205-558c-9967-f8c8388551d2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "24777013-b8d3-5e04-b08c-96de9e04799e" :question/id #uuid "24777013-b8d3-5e04-b08c-96de9e04799e"] [:db/add "24777013-b8d3-5e04-b08c-96de9e04799e" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3 \\tan{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 1\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "24777013-b8d3-5e04-b08c-96de9e04799e" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{1}{x + 1}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{\\left(x + 1\\right)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3 \\tan{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 1\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-3\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-3\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- 3 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- 3 \\sec{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "24777013-b8d3-5e04-b08c-96de9e04799e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "24777013-b8d3-5e04-b08c-96de9e04799e" :question/answer-fields "87314e5a-9205-558c-9967-f8c8388551d2"] [:db/ensure "24777013-b8d3-5e04-b08c-96de9e04799e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "24777013-b8d3-5e04-b08c-96de9e04799e"] [:db/add "99cb5b39-8bb1-5c72-a923-b3ac1322ce6d" :answer/id #uuid "99cb5b39-8bb1-5c72-a923-b3ac1322ce6d"] [:db/add "99cb5b39-8bb1-5c72-a923-b3ac1322ce6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "99cb5b39-8bb1-5c72-a923-b3ac1322ce6d" :answer/value "- 2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{1}{x} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "99cb5b39-8bb1-5c72-a923-b3ac1322ce6d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5986715d-a74a-5b9a-b607-4c452d53ca11" :answer-field/id #uuid "5986715d-a74a-5b9a-b607-4c452d53ca11"] [:db/add "5986715d-a74a-5b9a-b607-4c452d53ca11" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "5986715d-a74a-5b9a-b607-4c452d53ca11" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5986715d-a74a-5b9a-b607-4c452d53ca11" :answer-field/choices "99cb5b39-8bb1-5c72-a923-b3ac1322ce6d"] [:db/add "5986715d-a74a-5b9a-b607-4c452d53ca11" :answer-field/correct "99cb5b39-8bb1-5c72-a923-b3ac1322ce6d"] [:db/ensure "5986715d-a74a-5b9a-b607-4c452d53ca11" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "22800ce1-22b4-5647-895c-5fa618aed8f1" :question/id #uuid "22800ce1-22b4-5647-895c-5fa618aed8f1"] [:db/add "22800ce1-22b4-5647-895c-5fa618aed8f1" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{1}{x} \\right)}}{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "22800ce1-22b4-5647-895c-5fa618aed8f1" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{1}{x}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{x^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{1}{x} \\right)}}{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-2\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-2\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- 2 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- 2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{1}{x} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "22800ce1-22b4-5647-895c-5fa618aed8f1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "22800ce1-22b4-5647-895c-5fa618aed8f1" :question/answer-fields "5986715d-a74a-5b9a-b607-4c452d53ca11"] [:db/ensure "22800ce1-22b4-5647-895c-5fa618aed8f1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "22800ce1-22b4-5647-895c-5fa618aed8f1"] [:db/add "c92f433a-937c-5532-a6df-6b18894cce0a" :answer/id #uuid "c92f433a-937c-5532-a6df-6b18894cce0a"] [:db/add "c92f433a-937c-5532-a6df-6b18894cce0a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c92f433a-937c-5532-a6df-6b18894cce0a" :answer/value "6 \\sin{\\left(\\sqrt{x} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "c92f433a-937c-5532-a6df-6b18894cce0a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0faef82f-02d8-5038-818a-943e69f8cdd6" :answer-field/id #uuid "0faef82f-02d8-5038-818a-943e69f8cdd6"] [:db/add "0faef82f-02d8-5038-818a-943e69f8cdd6" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "0faef82f-02d8-5038-818a-943e69f8cdd6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0faef82f-02d8-5038-818a-943e69f8cdd6" :answer-field/choices "c92f433a-937c-5532-a6df-6b18894cce0a"] [:db/add "0faef82f-02d8-5038-818a-943e69f8cdd6" :answer-field/correct "c92f433a-937c-5532-a6df-6b18894cce0a"] [:db/ensure "0faef82f-02d8-5038-818a-943e69f8cdd6" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c682838c-441d-52c4-bca4-1c893d76ddf0" :question/id #uuid "c682838c-441d-52c4-bca4-1c893d76ddf0"] [:db/add "c682838c-441d-52c4-bca4-1c893d76ddf0" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3 \\cos{\\left(\\sqrt{x} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "c682838c-441d-52c4-bca4-1c893d76ddf0" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\sqrt{x}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{x}}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3 \\cos{\\left(\\sqrt{x} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=6\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n6\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=6 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n6 \\sin{\\left(\\sqrt{x} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c682838c-441d-52c4-bca4-1c893d76ddf0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c682838c-441d-52c4-bca4-1c893d76ddf0" :question/answer-fields "0faef82f-02d8-5038-818a-943e69f8cdd6"] [:db/ensure "c682838c-441d-52c4-bca4-1c893d76ddf0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "c682838c-441d-52c4-bca4-1c893d76ddf0"] [:db/add "ca3b5931-f6f4-509b-9e40-761a804b4cc5" :answer/id #uuid "ca3b5931-f6f4-509b-9e40-761a804b4cc5"] [:db/add "ca3b5931-f6f4-509b-9e40-761a804b4cc5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ca3b5931-f6f4-509b-9e40-761a804b4cc5" :answer/value "3 \\csc{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "ca3b5931-f6f4-509b-9e40-761a804b4cc5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d2c077f1-ff65-5ca9-9bf2-de0b82cbbd6a" :answer-field/id #uuid "d2c077f1-ff65-5ca9-9bf2-de0b82cbbd6a"] [:db/add "d2c077f1-ff65-5ca9-9bf2-de0b82cbbd6a" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "d2c077f1-ff65-5ca9-9bf2-de0b82cbbd6a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d2c077f1-ff65-5ca9-9bf2-de0b82cbbd6a" :answer-field/choices "ca3b5931-f6f4-509b-9e40-761a804b4cc5"] [:db/add "d2c077f1-ff65-5ca9-9bf2-de0b82cbbd6a" :answer-field/correct "ca3b5931-f6f4-509b-9e40-761a804b4cc5"] [:db/ensure "d2c077f1-ff65-5ca9-9bf2-de0b82cbbd6a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a4521fc6-cec0-581c-b41b-3c4297dc34f4" :question/id #uuid "a4521fc6-cec0-581c-b41b-3c4297dc34f4"] [:db/add "a4521fc6-cec0-581c-b41b-3c4297dc34f4" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "a4521fc6-cec0-581c-b41b-3c4297dc34f4" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{1}{x + 2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{\\left(x + 2\\right)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-3\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-3\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3 \\csc{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a4521fc6-cec0-581c-b41b-3c4297dc34f4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a4521fc6-cec0-581c-b41b-3c4297dc34f4" :question/answer-fields "d2c077f1-ff65-5ca9-9bf2-de0b82cbbd6a"] [:db/ensure "a4521fc6-cec0-581c-b41b-3c4297dc34f4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "a4521fc6-cec0-581c-b41b-3c4297dc34f4"] [:db/add "2730e8aa-499d-5cb6-b163-5f63d3219b35" :answer/id #uuid "2730e8aa-499d-5cb6-b163-5f63d3219b35"] [:db/add "2730e8aa-499d-5cb6-b163-5f63d3219b35" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2730e8aa-499d-5cb6-b163-5f63d3219b35" :answer/value "2 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "2730e8aa-499d-5cb6-b163-5f63d3219b35" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c909eb6e-d85d-5f5d-abf7-70781ca5732c" :answer-field/id #uuid "c909eb6e-d85d-5f5d-abf7-70781ca5732c"] [:db/add "c909eb6e-d85d-5f5d-abf7-70781ca5732c" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "c909eb6e-d85d-5f5d-abf7-70781ca5732c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c909eb6e-d85d-5f5d-abf7-70781ca5732c" :answer-field/choices "2730e8aa-499d-5cb6-b163-5f63d3219b35"] [:db/add "c909eb6e-d85d-5f5d-abf7-70781ca5732c" :answer-field/correct "2730e8aa-499d-5cb6-b163-5f63d3219b35"] [:db/ensure "c909eb6e-d85d-5f5d-abf7-70781ca5732c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e19875d8-3438-5edf-9e74-07e21ace86b3" :question/id #uuid "e19875d8-3438-5edf-9e74-07e21ace86b3"] [:db/add "e19875d8-3438-5edf-9e74-07e21ace86b3" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "e19875d8-3438-5edf-9e74-07e21ace86b3" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{1}{x + 2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{\\left(x + 2\\right)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-2\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-2\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e19875d8-3438-5edf-9e74-07e21ace86b3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e19875d8-3438-5edf-9e74-07e21ace86b3" :question/answer-fields "c909eb6e-d85d-5f5d-abf7-70781ca5732c"] [:db/ensure "e19875d8-3438-5edf-9e74-07e21ace86b3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "e19875d8-3438-5edf-9e74-07e21ace86b3"] [:db/add "a299121f-f4cf-5c1c-b79d-ecf655605c39" :answer/id #uuid "a299121f-f4cf-5c1c-b79d-ecf655605c39"] [:db/add "a299121f-f4cf-5c1c-b79d-ecf655605c39" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a299121f-f4cf-5c1c-b79d-ecf655605c39" :answer/value "- 3 \\tan{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "a299121f-f4cf-5c1c-b79d-ecf655605c39" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6b60acb8-5432-523c-8dad-41923bfdbd12" :answer-field/id #uuid "6b60acb8-5432-523c-8dad-41923bfdbd12"] [:db/add "6b60acb8-5432-523c-8dad-41923bfdbd12" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "6b60acb8-5432-523c-8dad-41923bfdbd12" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "6b60acb8-5432-523c-8dad-41923bfdbd12" :answer-field/choices "a299121f-f4cf-5c1c-b79d-ecf655605c39"] [:db/add "6b60acb8-5432-523c-8dad-41923bfdbd12" :answer-field/correct "a299121f-f4cf-5c1c-b79d-ecf655605c39"] [:db/ensure "6b60acb8-5432-523c-8dad-41923bfdbd12" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2f8236fc-77ad-5c64-a431-aa60a8046451" :question/id #uuid "2f8236fc-77ad-5c64-a431-aa60a8046451"] [:db/add "2f8236fc-77ad-5c64-a431-aa60a8046451" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 1\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "2f8236fc-77ad-5c64-a431-aa60a8046451" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{1}{x + 1}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{\\left(x + 1\\right)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 1\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-3\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-3\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- 3 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- 3 \\tan{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "2f8236fc-77ad-5c64-a431-aa60a8046451" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "2f8236fc-77ad-5c64-a431-aa60a8046451" :question/answer-fields "6b60acb8-5432-523c-8dad-41923bfdbd12"] [:db/ensure "2f8236fc-77ad-5c64-a431-aa60a8046451" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "2f8236fc-77ad-5c64-a431-aa60a8046451"] [:db/add "2218cbe4-bd68-5685-ad28-4aca4e2ba34c" :answer/id #uuid "2218cbe4-bd68-5685-ad28-4aca4e2ba34c"] [:db/add "2218cbe4-bd68-5685-ad28-4aca4e2ba34c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2218cbe4-bd68-5685-ad28-4aca4e2ba34c" :answer/value "- 6 \\cos{\\left(\\sqrt{x + 1} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "2218cbe4-bd68-5685-ad28-4aca4e2ba34c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "566a9c50-0c75-5972-9f2c-4b8dac58354b" :answer-field/id #uuid "566a9c50-0c75-5972-9f2c-4b8dac58354b"] [:db/add "566a9c50-0c75-5972-9f2c-4b8dac58354b" :